 R←TestStyle;m;fns;code;branching;bare;data;long;vars;lower
⍝ No function in the modern version branches with → or exceeds 100
⍝ lines; data tables are reached only through Data; variables in the
⍝ modern namespace are constants, named in upper case
 m←## ⋄ R←1
 fns←m.⎕NL ¯3
 code←{⍵/⍨~∨\'⍝'=⍵}¨¨m.⎕NR¨fns          ⍝ source lines without comments
 code←('''[^'']*'''⎕R'''''')¨code          ⍝ ... and without the text of strings
 branching←fns/⍨∨/¨'→'∊¨¨code
 :If 0≠≢branching
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestStyle: → in: ',⍕branching ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf
 long←fns/⍨100<≢¨m.⎕NR¨fns
 :If 0≠≢long
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestStyle: over 100 lines: ',⍕long ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf
 data←'planets' 'moon' 'kohoutek' 'STARS' 'BRIGHT' 'BP' 'STARNAMES' 'PLANETNAMES'
 data,←'STARCONSTELLATION' 'CONSTELLATIONS' 'reference_positions'
 data,←'AXITILT' 'CATEPOCH' 'EQUINOX' 'MOONRATIO' 'TROPYR' 'YRLENGTH'
 bare←fns/⍨{0≠≢('(?<![\w.])(',(¯1↓∊data,¨'|'),')(?!\w)')⎕S 0⊢⍵}¨code
 :If 0≠≢bare
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestStyle: data table not reached through Data in: ',⍕bare ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf
 vars←m.⎕NL ¯2
 lower←vars/⍨{∨/⍵∊⎕C ⎕A}¨vars
 :If 0≠≢lower
     ⎕←'FAIL: TestStyle: variable not named in upper case: ',⍕lower ⋄ R←0
 :EndIf
 :If R
     ⎕←'PASS: TestStyle (',(⍕≢fns),' functions, ',(⍕≢vars),' constants)'
 :EndIf
